# Costing Decision 5 (open)

- Work with Option B: metal price = LME/Base only.
- Do not merge Premium, Clearance or Shipping into Direct RM (Option A) before the user signs Decision 5.
- Optional components SHIPPING, PREMIUM, CLEARANCE, SURCHARGE, CONTAINER_SHIPMENT port as-is: value 0 with a warning when missing. No silent defaults beyond that.
- Same formulas, rounding and operation order as legacy. Phase 5 requires golden numeric tests (>= 30 real cases) with zero numeric difference.
